                  "text": "This robot is a 6-DOF biped that is currently under development for strategic dynamic walking and stair traversal. We have currently worked on the Accuracy of the Inverse Kinematics of the robot to find the joint angles for a given step length and height. Our current objectives include:\n1. Developing a full-functional control and gait system\n2.An optimized trajectory for dynamic walking\n3. Building the entire software in ROS 2"
