                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "CNC 2D Plotter is a project designed to draw a specific diagram on paper by giving the commands from the computer. It uses a software called Inkscape which allows us to draw vector graphics on the computer and then generates a G-code. It uses a CNC Shield on top of the Arduino UNO board. The movement along the axes is done by using stepper motors and a servo motor."
